  },
  "466": {
    "codebook_rule": [
      "1",
      "4"
    ],
    "document_id": "466",
    "explanation": "The release announces that Syracuse will receive grant funding and trees as part of an initiative launched by Senator Clinton. It says the donation was secured through a public-private partnership and quotes partners praising her initiative. It presents the senator as responsible for securing a concrete benefit for New York cities through her advocacy and partnership effort, satisfying rules about obtaining concrete benefits and intervention producing benefits.",
