  },
  "1901": {
    "codebook_rule": ["1", "2", "5"],
    "document_id": "1901",
    "explanation": "The text says the Senate passed the Dignified Treatment of Wounded Warriors Act and that it includes provisions Senator Collins coauthored, as well as a provision authored by Collins. It presents passage/inclusion of legislation and attributes provisions to Collins as author, which satisfies rules 1, 2, and 5.",
